# ============================================================================
# FerrisPulse Git Ignore Rules
# 遵从纯净开源仓库准则：源码、文档与测试入库，严禁向版本管理提交任何编译二进制
# ============================================================================

# 1. 编译产物与二进制文件 (Build Artifacts - 严禁提交，发布走 GitHub Releases)
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.obj
*.raw.exe
FerrisPulse.exe
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
FerrisPulse_v2.0_Portable.zip
Obfuscated/

# 2. 本地归档、宣传制作素材与草稿调试 (Local & Internal Assets)
adapters/
archive/
promo/
tools/scratch/
scratch/
assets/archive_screenshots/
.superpowers/
.cursorrules
*.log
*.tmp
aumid_debug.txt
.env*
.release_env
*token*
docs/RELEASE_WORKFLOW_SOP.md

# 3. 多媒体素材与视频音效
*.mp4
*.wav
*.m4a
*.jpg

# 4. 图片资源管控 (仅允许官方 Logo 与核心 UI 矢量资源)
*.png
!app.png
!resources/*.png
!src/UI/Resources/mouse_body.png

# 5. 文本与配置管控
*.txt
!docs/FAQ.txt
!docs/CHANGELOG_LEGACY.txt

# 6. 保留核心工程与测试目录
!tests/
!tools/
!docs/
!src/
!resources/
